#: ../developer/installation.md:1
msgid "Installation"
msgstr "安装"

#: ../developer/installation.md:3
msgid ""
"This page gets a gateway running, as the Docker stack or as a source "
"checkout you can edit. To see a gateway answer a request first, with no "
"provider account, API key or `.env`, try the [Quickstart](router-"
"tutorial.md)."
msgstr ""
"本页讲怎样把网关运行起来：用 Docker 服务栈，或者用可以修改的源码检出。想先看到网关应答请求，而不需要 provider 账号、API "
"key 或 `.env`，请试试[快速上手](router-tutorial.md)。"

#: ../developer/installation.md:7
msgid "What you need"
msgstr "需要准备什么"

#: ../developer/installation.md
msgid "For"
msgstr "运行方式"

#: ../developer/installation.md
msgid "Requirement"
msgstr "要求"

#: ../developer/installation.md
msgid "The Docker stack"
msgstr "Docker 服务栈"

#: ../developer/installation.md
msgid "Docker Engine 24+ and Docker Compose v2+"
msgstr "Docker Engine 24+ 与 Docker Compose v2+"

#: ../developer/installation.md
msgid "A source checkout"
msgstr "从源码运行"

#: ../developer/installation.md
msgid ""
"Python 3.11–3.13 (3.12 recommended) and [uv](https://github.com/astral-"
"sh/uv)"
msgstr "Python 3.11–3.13（推荐 3.12）和 [uv](https://github.com/astral-sh/uv)"

#: ../developer/installation.md
msgid "Running the console outside Docker"
msgstr "在 Docker 之外运行控制台"

#: ../developer/installation.md
msgid "Node.js 22"
msgstr "Node.js 22"

#: ../developer/installation.md:15
msgid "Linux or macOS."
msgstr "Linux 或 macOS。"

#: ../developer/installation.md:17
msgid "Running with Docker"
msgstr "用 Docker 运行"

#: ../developer/installation.md:25
msgid ""
"Fill in `DB_USER` and `DB_PASSWORD` in `.env` (`DB_NAME` is already set);"
" Compose refuses to start without all three. Nothing else in `.env` is "
"required: provider keys, mail, proxy trust and the other settings are "
"stored in the database and set from the console. Then start the stack:"
msgstr ""
"在 `.env` 中填写 `DB_USER` 和 `DB_PASSWORD`（`DB_NAME` 已经设好）；三者缺一，Compose "
"就拒绝启动。`.env` 中的其他内容都不是必需的：provider key、邮件、代理信任等设置项存储在数据库里，从控制台设置。然后启动服务栈："

#: ../developer/installation.md:36
msgid ""
"The backend listens on `127.0.0.1:8080`, the console on `127.0.0.1:3001` "
"and Postgres on `127.0.0.1:5432`. Read the [Deployment "
"Guide](deployment.md) before exposing them."
msgstr ""
"后端监听 `127.0.0.1:8080`，控制台监听 `127.0.0.1:3001`，Postgres 监听 "
"`127.0.0.1:5432`。对外开放之前请先阅读[部署指南](deployment.md)。"

#: ../developer/installation.md:40
msgid ""
"The database lives in the Docker volume `hybridinference_postgres_data`, "
"which `docker compose down -v` does not delete; see [Resetting the "
"stack](deployment.md#resetting-the-stack). After changing `.env`, run "
"`make up` again, not `make restart`: a container reads `.env` only when "
"it is created."
msgstr ""
"数据库保存在 Docker 卷 `hybridinference_postgres_data` 中，`docker compose down "
"-v` 不会删除它；见[重置服务栈](deployment.md#resetting-the-stack)。修改 `.env` 后要重新运行 "
"`make up`，而不是 `make restart`：容器只在创建时读取 `.env`。"

#: ../developer/installation.md:46
msgid "First-run setup"
msgstr "首次运行设置"

#: ../developer/installation.md:48
msgid ""
"On its first start against an empty database, the backend generates "
"`JWT_SECRET_KEY` (signs sign-in tokens) and `API_KEY_SECRET` (protects "
"API keys), stores them in the database, and logs a one-time setup code:"
msgstr ""
"后端第一次连上空数据库启动时，会生成 `JWT_SECRET_KEY`（签发登录令牌）和 `API_KEY_SECRET`（保护 API "
"key），存入数据库，并在日志中打印一次性设置码："

#: ../developer/installation.md:56
msgid ""
"Open the console at `http://localhost:3001`; it sends you to its setup "
"page."
msgstr "打开控制台 `http://localhost:3001`，它会把你带到设置页面。"

#: ../developer/installation.md:58
msgid ""
"Enter the setup code. It stays the same until setup is done and is logged"
" at every start. Until then the backend refuses all sign-ups."
msgstr "输入设置码。设置完成之前它保持不变，每次启动都会打印。在此之前，后端拒绝所有注册。"

#: ../developer/installation.md:60
msgid ""
"Create the administrator: a username and a password, no email. Pick a "
"username that is hard to guess, not `admin`: sign-in attempts are counted"
" per username, so anyone who knows it can lock the account out of new "
"browsers. See [The first admin account](deployment.md#the-first-admin-"
"account)."
msgstr ""
"创建管理员：用户名和密码，没有邮箱。选一个难以猜到的用户名，不要用 "
"`admin`：登录尝试按用户名计数，知道用户名的人就能让新浏览器无法登录这个账号。见[第一个管理员账号](deployment.md#the-"
"first-admin-account)。"

#: ../developer/installation.md:64
msgid ""
"Fill in the required deployment settings. The gateway installs no sample "
"models; missing configuration shows **Ask admin to configure**."
msgstr "填写必需的部署设置项。网关不安装示例模型；配置缺失时会显示 **Ask admin to configure**。"

#: ../developer/installation.md:66
msgid ""
"Add a provider and key, and create a model in **Admin → Routing**. Verify"
" the route before making the model available to users. Aliases and other "
"metadata are in the model catalog, **Admin → Routing → Models**. Follow "
"the **Restart required** markers."
msgstr ""
"添加一个 provider 和 key，并在 **Admin → Routing** "
"中创建模型。把模型开放给用户之前先验证路由。别名和其他元数据在模型目录 **Admin → Routing → Models** 中。按 "
"**Restart required** 标记操作。"

#: ../developer/installation.md:72
msgid ""
"Keep the database together with its secrets. `API_KEY_SECRET` can never "
"change: a new value would break every API key. Changing `JWT_SECRET_KEY` "
"signs everyone out. `ERASURE_FENCE_SECRET` takes `API_KEY_SECRET`'s value"
" unless you set it in `.env` before the first start, and cannot change "
"afterwards either; see [Database](database.md#secrets-for-deleting-"
"accounts)."
msgstr ""
"把数据库和其中的密钥放在一起保管。`API_KEY_SECRET` 永远不能更改：新值会让所有 API key 失效。更改 "
"`JWT_SECRET_KEY` 会让所有人退出登录。除非在首次启动前在 `.env` 中设置了 "
"`ERASURE_FENCE_SECRET`，否则它取 `API_KEY_SECRET` "
"的值，之后同样不能更改；见[数据库](database.md#secrets-for-deleting-accounts)。"

#: ../developer/installation.md:79
msgid ""
"A gateway with `DB_ENABLED=false` has no setup step and reads every "
"setting from the environment, so with user authentication on it needs "
"`JWT_SECRET_KEY` and `API_KEY_SECRET` there. Only `DB_ENABLED=false` "
"together with `USER_AUTH_ENABLED=false` runs without them, as in Stage 1 "
"of the [Quickstart](router-tutorial.md)."
msgstr ""
"`DB_ENABLED=false` 的网关没有设置步骤，所有设置项都从环境变量读取，因此在开启用户认证时，需要在环境变量中提供 "
"`JWT_SECRET_KEY` 和 `API_KEY_SECRET`。只有同时设置 `DB_ENABLED=false` 和 "
"`USER_AUTH_ENABLED=false` 才能不提供它们，就像[快速上手](router-tutorial.md)的第 1 阶段那样。"

#: ../developer/installation.md:85
msgid "Development checkout (no Docker)"
msgstr "本地开发（不用 Docker）"

#: ../developer/installation.md:94
msgid ""
"`make setup-dev` creates `.venv` on Python 3.12 (it refuses an existing "
"`.venv` on another minor version), installs the project editable with the"
" `dev` dependency group, and installs the pre-commit hooks. By hand:"
msgstr ""
"`make setup-dev` 用 Python 3.12 创建 `.venv`（已有的 `.venv` "
"是其他次版本时会拒绝继续），以可编辑方式安装项目及 `dev` 依赖组，并安装 pre-commit 钩子。手动操作："

#: ../developer/installation.md:104
msgid "Run the gateway from the repository root, where it reads `.env`:"
msgstr "在仓库根目录运行网关，它会在那里读取 `.env`："

#: ../developer/installation.md:111
msgid ""
"With a database, the setup code appears in this terminal. Run the console"
" in a second terminal:"
msgstr "有数据库时，设置码会出现在这个终端中。在第二个终端中运行控制台："

#: ../developer/installation.md:120
msgid ""
"Open `http://localhost:3001`. The console forwards API paths to "
"`BACKEND_INTERNAL_URL`, whose default `http://backend:8080` exists only "
"inside Docker, and it does not read `.env`, so set it each time. Check "
"the whole path with `curl http://localhost:3001/health`."
msgstr ""
"打开 `http://localhost:3001`。控制台把 API 路径转发到 `BACKEND_INTERNAL_URL`，它的默认值 "
"`http://backend:8080` 只在 Docker 内部存在，而控制台不读取 `.env`，所以每次启动都要设置。用 `curl "
"http://localhost:3001/health` 检查整条链路。"

#: ../developer/installation.md:125
msgid "To run only the database:"
msgstr "只运行数据库："

#: ../developer/installation.md:132
msgid ""
"For a gateway without accounts or a database, set `DB_ENABLED=false` and "
"`USER_AUTH_ENABLED=false` in `.env`. It still routes requests; accounts, "
"API keys, request history and stored settings need the database."
msgstr ""
"如果要运行没有账号和数据库的网关，在 `.env` 中设置 `DB_ENABLED=false` 和 "
"`USER_AUTH_ENABLED=false`。它照样路由请求；账号、API key、请求历史和存储的设置项都需要数据库。"

#: ../developer/installation.md:136
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "配置"

#: ../developer/installation.md:138
msgid ""
"`.env` holds only what the backend needs before it reaches the database "
"and what describes the containers: the `DB_*` connection, host ports and "
"bind addresses, and a few process and console values (see "
"`.env.example`). Every other setting lives in the database and is edited "
"in **Admin → Settings**. An environment value only seeds an empty "
"database row at startup; after that the stored value wins. See "
"[Configuration](configuration.md)."
msgstr ""
"`.env` 只保存后端连上数据库之前就需要的内容，以及描述容器的内容：`DB_*` 连接、主机端口和绑定地址，以及少量进程和控制台的值（见 "
"`.env.example`）。其他所有设置项都在数据库中，在 **Admin → Settings** "
"中编辑。环境变量的值只在启动时填充数据库中尚无值的行；此后以存储的值为准。见[配置](configuration.md)。"

#: ../developer/installation.md:145
msgid "Settings to review on a new deployment:"
msgstr "新部署需要检查的设置项："

#: ../developer/installation.md:71
msgid "Setting"
msgstr "设置项"

#: ../developer/installation.md:71
msgid "Effect"
msgstr "作用"

#: ../developer/installation.md:71
msgid "`BASE_URL`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/installation.md:71
msgid ""
"This gateway's public origin, used in signup and password-reset links. "
"Set it behind a TLS proxy: the server ignores `X-Forwarded-*`, so a blank"
" value builds `http://…` links"
msgstr ""
"本网关的公开源地址，用于注册和重置密码邮件中的链接。在 TLS 代理之后一定要设置：服务器不解析 `X-Forwarded-*`，留空会生成 "
"`http://…` 链接"

#: ../developer/installation.md:71
msgid "`FRONTEND_URL`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/installation.md:71
msgid "Console URL your users click in emails"
msgstr "用户在邮件中点击的控制台 URL"

#: ../developer/installation.md:71
msgid "`USER_AUTH_ENABLED`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/installation.md:71
msgid "`1` (default) requires an API key for inference; `0` allows anonymous inference but keeps account and admin sign-in. A runtime switch in **Admin → Settings → Sign-in & security**"
msgstr "`1`（默认）要求推理请求携带 API key；`0` 允许匿名推理，但账号登录和管理员认证照常。这是 **Admin → Settings → Sign-in & security** 中的运行时开关"

#: ../developer/installation.md:71
msgid "`DB_STORE_FULL_CONTENT`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/installation.md:71
msgid ""
"`false` (default) stores no prompts or responses; see [Request logging "
"and privacy](database.md#request-logging-and-privacy)"
msgstr "`false`（默认）完全不存储提示词和响应；见[请求日志与隐私](database.md#request-logging-and-privacy)"

#: ../developer/installation.md:71
msgid "`TRUST_PROXY_HEADERS` and the other proxy settings"
msgstr "`TRUST_PROXY_HEADERS` 及其他代理设置项"

#: ../developer/installation.md:71
msgid ""
"Which proxies may report client addresses; see [Trusted Proxies and "
"Client IPs](trusted-proxies-and-client-ips.md)"
msgstr "哪些代理可以报告客户端地址；见[可信代理与客户端 IP](trusted-proxies-and-client-ips.md)"

#: ../developer/installation.md:71
msgid "`ADMIN_TOKEN`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/installation.md:71
msgid "Optional legacy bearer token for `/admin/*`; blank disables it"
msgstr "可选的旧式 `/admin/*` Bearer 令牌；留空即禁用"

#: ../developer/installation.md:71
msgid "`PROVIDER_ROUTE_TYPES`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/installation.md:71
msgid ""
"Route types Admin may add per provider, as comma-separated "
"`provider=type[|type]` entries (e.g. "
"`chutes=quota,openrouter=concurrency|on_demand`); blank allows all"
msgstr ""
"Admin 可以为每个 provider 添加的路由类型，写成逗号分隔的 `provider=type[|type]` 条目（例如 "
"`chutes=quota,openrouter=concurrency|on_demand`）；留空表示不限制"

#: ../developer/installation.md:157
msgid ""
"Set proxy trust in `.env` before the first start, or in Admin afterwards."
" Under Compose the first start stores `TRUST_PROXY_HEADERS` and "
"`TRUST_CLOUDFLARE_HEADERS` as `0` when `.env` does not set them, and "
"later `.env` edits are ignored."
msgstr ""
"在首次启动前把代理信任写进 `.env`，或者之后在 Admin 中设置。在 Compose 下，如果 `.env` 没有设置 "
"`TRUST_PROXY_HEADERS` 和 `TRUST_CLOUDFLARE_HEADERS`，首次启动会把它们存为 `0`，之后对 "
"`.env` 的修改会被忽略。"

#: ../developer/installation.md:162
msgid "Provider credentials"
msgstr "Provider 凭据"

#: ../developer/installation.md:164
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"A model's `api_key`, `api_keys`, `base_url` and `provider_model_id` can "
"each be a `${VAR}` reference. It resolves to the stored setting of that "
"name, else the environment variable, else the gateway's registered "
"default. Only a whole value is substituted, so `${VAR:-default}` and "
"`${VAR}` inside a longer string stay literal."
msgstr ""
"模型的 `api_key`、`api_keys`、`base_url` 和 `provider_model_id` 都可以写成 `${VAR}` "
"引用。它依次解析为同名的已存储设置项、环境变量、网关注册的默认值。只替换整个值，所以 `${VAR:-default}` 以及嵌在更长字符串中的 "
"`${VAR}` 都保持原样。"

#: ../developer/installation.md:182
msgid "**Admin → Settings → Providers** lists every variable the model catalog names, marks the ones a model needs, and stores their values; **Add variable** adds a name it does not list yet. Restart the backend after changing one. A provider key whose description mentions numbered extras, such as `OPENROUTER_API_KEY`, also accepts `OPENROUTER_API_KEY1` to `OPENROUTER_API_KEY20`; every one with a value joins the provider's key pool. Keys added in the **Keys** section of **Admin → Providers** join the same pool without a restart."
msgstr "**Admin → Settings → Providers** 列出模型目录引用的每个变量，标出模型必需的变量，并存储它们的值；**Add variable** 可以添加尚未列出的名字。修改后要重启后端。说明中提到编号扩展的 provider key（例如 `OPENROUTER_API_KEY`）还接受 `OPENROUTER_API_KEY1` 到 `OPENROUTER_API_KEY20`；每个有值的 key 都加入该 provider 的 key 池。在 **Admin → Providers** 的 **Keys** 部分添加的 key 也加入同一个池，无需重启。"

#: ../developer/installation.md:190
msgid "Verifying the install"
msgstr "验证安装"

#: ../developer/installation.md:201
