"还没有注册任何模型：在 **Admin → Routing** 中创建一个。启动日志会说明存储的模型目录是否加载成功（`Registered N "
"routes from the database route catalog`），或者写明问题所在"

#: ../developer/installation.md:71
msgid "Port already in use"
msgstr "端口已被占用"

#: ../developer/installation.md:71
msgid "Override `BACKEND_PORT`, `FRONTEND_PORT` or `DB_PORT` in `.env`"
msgstr "在 `.env` 中改用其他 `BACKEND_PORT`、`FRONTEND_PORT` 或 `DB_PORT`"

